  "name": "Implement AttackResolver Domain Service",
  "description": "Create the AttackResolver domain service - resolves single attack.\n\nFile: src/domain/services/attack_resolver.py\n\nImplementation requirements:\n- Pure domain service (no infrastructure dependencies)\n- Constructor takes DiceRoller port for damage calculation\n- Method: resolve(attacker: Character, defender: Character) -> AttackResult\n- Damage = attack_power (fixed, no roll needed per simplified rules)\n- Returns AttackResult with updated defender HP (floored at 0)",
  "motivation": "AttackResolver handles damage calculation and HP reduction",
  "estimated_hours": 0.5,
  "execution_agent": "software-crafter",
  "dependencies": ["01-01", "01-02", "02-01"],
