    "AttackResolver accepts DiceRoller in constructor",
    "resolve() returns AttackResult with correct damage",
    "Damage equals attacker's attack_power",
    "Defender HP is reduced by damage amount",
    "Defender HP floors at 0 (never negative)",
    "E2E Scenario 4 (damage) passes"
  ],
  "unit_tests_required": [
    "test_attack_deals_attacker_power_as_damage",
